ion. By implementing tiered liability—where consumer-facing applications follow standard insurance models and critical infrastructure adheres to strict, pre-funded reserve requirements—we create a robust framework that encourages rapid iteration while insulating society from systemic collapse. This approach allows us to capture the immense benefits of AI progress without sacrificing the safety of the public.",
